description:
Your Task

- Manage the indicated IT Security products and services, taking into account the guidelines of the strategy, setting the goal of increasing sales of products, defining requirements and organizing iterations;

- Active monitoring and control of the marketing strategy in relation to the IT Security product group in the short and long term, including ongoing monitoring of the activities of competitors;

- Building, among others, product vision, Product Canvas, Story Map, Customer and User profiles; Product Backlog;

- Business and technical analysis of planned initiatives;

- Coordination of activities related to the implementation and development of Security products and services, e.g. in IT systems such as CRM or network infrastructure;

- Development and implementation of processes in the field of activation, provision, modification, deactivation of ICT security services;

- Detecting threats for the implementation of projects and finding ways to neutralize threats;

- Management of product and design documentation and its updating during the product life cycle;

- Development of internal tools to support company employees;

- go-to-market activities for IT Security Products, including marketing materials, formal and legal, training for sellers and presales, communication, etc.;

- Supervise product training processes for business partners;

- Cooperation with strategic partners from the DT Group, other NATCOS and external clients;

- Active support for the sale of Security solutions by assisting in the implementation of solutions dedicated to the requirements of business partners;

- Monitoring the profitability of individual products and services.

- Reporting on the status of services in business and technical terms in cooperation with other units of the organization.

Your Profile

- Minimum 2-3 years of professional experience in the management of products and projects in the telecommunications or IT industry for Clients from the B2B segment;

- Higher education (in progress) in telecommunications, computer science, management or marketing;

- Knowledge of telecommunication standards and services market;

- Experience in the development and implementation of IT Security products for a business client;

- Ability to present recommendations resulting from analysis and marketing data;

- Good knowledge of English min. B2

- Creativity and independence in action;

- High level of communication and interpersonal skills;

- Entrepreneurship, dynamism in action, strategic thinking.

Welcomed:

- Knowledge of ITIL 4, PSPO I-III, PRINCE2
